{"body": "<!-- turn 1 | human | line 1 | bytes 64 | sha256 d2127983bad10dff3977c81f2da3b9ee35b728fd75b7c48d2d60da44f110659a -->\nPlan the garden beds for spring. Tomatoes need the sunny corner.\n\n<!-- turn 2 | assistant | line 2 | bytes 65 | sha256 75aa8857b8025040edf63992e9be7dcdda5df4c747adaae93b8eca978ae11b9a -->\nPut the tomatoes in the south-east bed and the basil beside them.\n\n<!-- turn 3 | human | line 3 | bytes 57 | sha256 99f1754359aa4ff050f54b876b04ec18e5302f9f8b81df7c7667ec514324c7a4 -->\nDecision: we will build raised beds from cedar, not pine.\n\n<!-- turn 4 | assistant | line 4 | bytes 56 | sha256 fb8302a23fb29d44cd5b2e0a548adeebdfe9f93e3fc812507043bb43f8f9f4f4 -->\nNoted: raised cedar beds. I will list the lumber needed.\n\n", "designation": null, "edition_b64": "", "export_sha256": null, "key": "claude-code:synthetic-garden", "kind": "session", "ledger_key": "", "meta": {"chair": "Claude Code", "created": "2026-10-01T14:00:00Z", "edition": 1, "edition_hash": "a1cd7729e4e9217495e23ece725538959bc10dee91fb7952ec47fc37aab444e6", "events": [], "id": "01M4EZ49WX4ZSJP26XBDEVAKMN", "kind": "session", "normalized": {"first_human_sha256": "d2127983bad10dff3977c81f2da3b9ee35b728fd75b7c48d2d60da44f110659a", "identity": "source", "malformed_lines": 0, "normalizer": 2, "omitted": {}, "redacted_turns": 0, "title": "garden-planning", "turns": 4, "turns_by_role": {"assistant": 2, "human": 2}}, "scope": "robert", "source": "claude-code:synthetic-garden", "source_hash": "aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa", "tags": ["claude-code"], "tier": "raw"}, "origin": "synthetic", "provider": "claude-code", "retained": {}, "source_hash": "aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa", "title": "Garden planning", "v": 1}
